[style name="Interaction_Style"]
if {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} == 1:
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join Whiskers rightmost
	if {Whiskers.New_Dialog} == true:
		Thorinn: Hey kitty, what are you doing in there?
		Whiskers: **shivering** Me-me-meow
		Thorinn: Looks like you’re really cold.
		Thorinn: It is starting to get dark. I’ll make a campfire to warm you up.
		set {Whiskers.New_Dialog} = false
	else:
		Whiskers: **shivers**
		Thorinn: I should hurry up and get this campfire going.
elif {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} == 2:
	join Thorinn left
	join Whiskers right
	if {Whiskers.New_Dialog} == true:
		Thorinn: Look at you! For such a small animal you have really big Whiskers!
		Thorinn: Hmm I like that! I think I will call you Whisker.
		Thorinn: You know what is funny?
		Thorinn: Even though I just met you, I feel like I’ve known you forever.
		Whiskers: I know, right!
		Thorinn: AAAAAAAAAAH!
		Whiskers: You can talk? I think I am hallucinating!
		Whiskers: No Thorinn, you're not! Don’t be scared.
		Whiskers: I can only communicate with you, you are the only one that will understand me when I talk. But I am not able to reveal why. At least not now...
		Whiskers: Don’t worry, I will be your friend, I will keep you company on this journey.
		Thorinn: Well, are you feeling better? Now that you’re warmed up.
		Whiskers: Thanks for asking. Well, I’m not cold anymore, but I’m a little hungry. Can you find me\
some fish and cook it on the fire?
		- Yes, search for some fish.
			[signal arg="start_fish_quest"]
		- No, ignore Whiskers.
			[signal arg="hugo_encounter"]
		- No, you try to scare Whiskers away.
			[signal arg="cat_leaves"]
			[wait time="3.0"]
			[signal arg="hugo_encounter"]
		set {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} = 3
	else:
elif {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} == 3:
	join Thorinn leftmost
	Hugo: hey, what are you doing here traveler?
	join Hugo rightmost
	Thorinn: I’ve lost my way as soon as it got darker.  What about you? Why are you here and who are you?
	Hugo: I’m Hugo. I saw your campfire while going on my daily evening walk.
	Hugo:  I’ve lived in Rockfall my whole life, so I know this forest by heart.
	Hugo: Can I help you reach Rockfall? The town is not that far anymore.
	- Yes
		[signal arg="follow_hugo"]
	- No
		[signal arg="leave_hugo"]
